Package: oowatch
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Continuous command scheduler and delta watcher with ANSI diff highlighting
 A sovereign continuous command scheduler and delta watcher written in pure
 openOODA, featuring periodic execution, ANSI delta line diff highlighting
 via oote themes, execution count bounds, and an MCP stdio server.
